 8D6D   0A92    '----- snap click to nearest hotspot within snr px (0 = off/exa
                ct)
 8D6D   0A92    '----- VERB-AWARE: only weighs hotpoints whose object verb = a$
                , so a look-click snaps to
 8D6D   0A92    '----- the nearest LOOK point, never a closer get/action point 
                that the action scan can't use
 8D6D   0A92    '----- ABS box just prefilters; sdd<snd is the real test = a ci
                rcle of radius snr (Euclidean)
